# Throwaway one-off probes. Real probes live in scripts/probe-*.mjs and are
# committed; these are written, run once against the dev server, and deleted
# in the same breath while chasing a specific bug. Ignoring them keeps a
# half-finished investigation from ever landing in a commit.
scratch-*.mjs
scratch-*.png

# Agent worktrees. They live inside the repo, so without this they get
# committed as gitlinks AND collected by vitest — three copies of every
# test file, and CPU contention that turns 900ms tests into 5s timeouts.
.claude/worktrees/
